 -\partial_s\Gamma^t{}_{rn}\\
&+\Gamma^p{}_{sn}\Gamma^t{}_{pr}
 -\Gamma^p{}_{rn}\Gamma^t{}_{ps}.
\end{split}$ Other texts may reverse the sign or arrange the indices differently; the convention is fixed by writing both  and .

